#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:2
msgid "Read the Docs team"
msgstr "Read the Docs 团队"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:4
msgid ""
"readthedocs.org is the largest open source documentation hosting service. "
"Today we:"
msgstr "readthedocs.org 是最大的开源文档托管服务。今天我们："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:7
msgid "Serve over **55 million pages** of documentation a month"
msgstr "每月提供超过 **5500 万个** 文档页面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:8
msgid "Serve over **40 TB** of documentation a month"
msgstr "每月提供超过 **40 TB** 的文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:9
msgid "Host over **80,000 open source projects** and support over **100,000 users**"
msgstr "托管超过 **80,000 个开源项目** ，服务超过 **100,000 名用户**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:11
msgid ""
"Read the Docs is provided as a free service to the open source community, "
"and we hope to maintain a reliable and stable hosting platform for years to "
"come."
msgstr "Read the Docs 作为免费服务提供给开源社区，我们希望未来多年都能维持一个可靠稳定的托管平台。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:16
msgid "`Our website: Who we are <https://about.readthedocs.com/company/>`__"
msgstr "`Our website: Who we are <https://about.readthedocs.com/company/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:17
msgid "More information about the staff and contributors of Read the Docs."
msgstr "关于 Read the Docs 员工和贡献者的更多信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:20
msgid "Teams"
msgstr "团队"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:22
msgid ""
"The **Backend Team** folks develop the Django code that powers the backend "
"of the project."
msgstr "**后端团队** 成员开发支撑项目后端的 Django 代码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:23
msgid ""
"The members of the **Frontend Team** care about UX, CSS, HTML, and "
"JavaScript, and they maintain the project UI as well as the Sphinx theme."
msgstr "**前端团队** 成员关注 UX、CSS、HTML 和 JavaScript，并维护项目 UI 及 Sphinx 主题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:25
msgid ""
"As part of operating the site, members of the **Operations Team** maintain a"
" 24/7 on-call rotation. This means that folks have to be available and have "
"their phone in service."
msgstr "作为站点运营的一部分，**运维团队** 成员维持 7×24 小时轮值待命。这意味着相关人员需随时可用并保持电话畅通。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:27
msgid ""
"The members of the **Advocacy Team** spread the word about all the work we "
"do, and seek to understand the users priorities and feedback."
msgstr "**推广团队** 成员宣传我们所做的一切工作，并努力理解用户的优先事项与反馈。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:29
msgid ""
"The **Support Team** helps our thousands of users using the service, "
"addressing tasks like resetting passwords, enable experimental features, or "
"troubleshooting build errors."
msgstr "**支持团队** 帮助我们数以千计的服务用户，处理重置密码、启用实验性功能、排查构建错误等事务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/team.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Please don't email us personally for support on Read the Docs.** You can "
"`use our support form <https://app.readthedocs.org/support/>`_ for any "
"issues you may have."
msgstr ""
"**请勿就 Read the Docs 支持事宜给我们发个人邮件。** 你遇到的任何问题都可以通过 `使用我们的支持表单 "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/support/>`_ 反馈。"

